mland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/louisiana/natchitoches-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Natchitoches Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/natchitoches-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the last pairs ran dry on the middle, with October to November at 68% and November to December at 45% of normal. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 159% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
